  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter (for the mash) and milk to potato and season with a generous pinch of salt. Mash until smooth. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f9492309bba91b1c08750e-6f3eaae8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f9492309bba91b1c08750e-6884aca9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot and chickpeas until tender, 4-6 minutes.\n• Add tomato, mild curry paste, Mumbai spice blend, garlic paste and the butter (for the curry), and cook stirring, until softened and fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f9492309bba91b1c08750e-19d00313.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium and stir in light cooking cream, the water and brown sugar, and cook until combined and slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add baby spinach leaves and cook, stirring, until slightly wilted, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f9492309bba91b1c08750e-06e60c63.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high.\n• Transfer chickpea curry into a baking dish and evenly spread mashed potato over the top. Sprinkle over Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill until cheese is golden, 5-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f9492309bba91b1c08750e-dc05614f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy Indian chickpea curry pie between plates.\n• Sprinkle over chilli flakes (if using!) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f9492309bba91b1c08750e-35acbef8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
